flowchart TB
  accTitle: Moonbase owner-directed work
  accDescr: The owner directs a Workbench with pinned profiles, workstreams, sources and approved lessons. A server-owned supervisor starts an owned native SDK session. Exact approved actions reach a scoped project worktree, and actual artifacts and receipts return for owner review. Reconnecting observes current state rather than replaying actions.
  Owner["Owner: task, direction and decisions"]
  Work["Workbench: live receipts and review"]
  Pins["Pinned profile, workstream, sources and approved lessons"]
  Supervisor["Server-owned supervisor"]
  SDK["Owned native SDK session"]
  Project["Scoped project worktree and approved tools"]
  Outcome["Artifacts, diff, checks and provenance"]
  Review["Owner outcome review"]
  Owner --> Work
  Work --> Pins
  Pins --> Supervisor
  Supervisor --> SDK
  SDK -->|"Exact approved actions"| Project
  Project --> Outcome
  SDK -->|"Structured messages and tool receipts"| Work
  Outcome --> Review
  Review -->|"Accept or request revision"| Work
  Supervisor -->|"Current state, not action replay"| Work
